{"timestamp": "2026-07-24T10:44:22.298646", "benchmark": "gaia", "group": "curated_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "gaia_4d0aa727-86b1-406b-9b33-f870dd14a4a5", "task_desc": "Answer the following question accurately.\n\nQuestion: The attached file lists the locomotives owned by a local railroad museum. It gives each locomotive’s identifying number, operating status, and the name of the daily excursion it heads, if operational. What are the odds that today’s Sunset Picnic Trip will use a steam locomotive? Assume that each day’s excursion picks one of its assigned locomotives at random, and express the answer in the form “1 in 4”, “1 in 5”, etc.", "augmented_prompt": "", "response": "I don't see an attached file in this conversation. To answer your question accurately, I need the file listing the locomotives, their identifying numbers, operating status, and assigned excursions.\n\nPlease upload or provide the file content (or paste the data), and I will:\n1. Filter for locomotives assigned to the \"Sunset Picnic Trip\"\n2. Count how many are steam vs. total assigned\n3. Compute the odds as \"1 in N\"\n\nOnce you share the file, I’ll give you the exact answer in the requested format.", "expected": "1 in 3", "score": 0.0, "em": 0.0, "method": "exact_match", "execution_mode": "default", "error": "", "category": "", "level": "2", "patch_injected": false, "aug_len": 0, "iteration": 0, "iter_total": 3, "mutated": false, "fb_score": 0.0, "fb_mode": "self", "code_rev": "5c172812", "critic_model": "grok-4.5", "metadata_author": "critic", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "meta", "score_provenance": "self_assessment", "judge_model": "hy3", "protocol_hash": "eaae534dbfcc", "prof_total_s": 3.8, "prof_embed_s": 0.0, "prof_docker_s": 0.0, "prof_llm_io_s": 3.8, "prof_tok_in": 323, "prof_tok_out": 114, "prof_llm_calls": 1}
