{"timestamp": "2026-07-24T10:51:29.636819", "benchmark": "gaia", "group": "curated_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "gaia_b7f857e4-d8aa-4387-af2a-0e844df5b9d8", "task_desc": "The attached image contains Python code. Execute that Python script using the string array provided below. The script's output will be a URL that points to some C++ source code. Take that C++ code, compile it, and run it against the integer array [35, 12, 8, 99, 21, 5]. After sorting, return the sum of the third and fifth elements.\n\narr = ['_alg', 'ghi', 'C++', 'jkl', 'tps', '/Q', 'pqr', 'stu', ':', '//', 'rose', 'vwx', 'yz1', '234', 'tta', '567', '890', 'cod', 'e.', 'or', 'g/', 'wiki', '/', 'in", "augmented_prompt": "## Curated prior attempts (this task's chain)\n\n[Prior attempt — store version v1]\nTask: The attached image contains a Python script. Run the Python code against an array of strings, listed below. The output of the Python script will be a \nAs recorded: https://rosecode.org/wiki/ing/sort.cpp\n\nSorted list: [5, 8, 12, 21, 35, 99]\nThird integer: 12\nFifth integer: 35\nSum: 47\n\n47", "response": "47", "expected": "47", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "method": "exact_match", "execution_mode": "default", "error": "", "category": "", "level": "2", "patch_injected": true, "aug_len": 375, "iteration": 1, "iter_total": 3, "mutated": true, "fb_score": 0.1, "fb_mode": "self", "code_rev": "5c172812", "critic_model": "grok-4.5", "metadata_author": "critic", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "meta", "score_provenance": "self_assessment", "judge_model": "hy3", "protocol_hash": "eaae534dbfcc", "prof_total_s": 271.27, "prof_embed_s": 0.0, "prof_docker_s": 0.0, "prof_llm_io_s": 271.27, "prof_tok_in": 526, "prof_tok_out": 2, "prof_llm_calls": 1}
