{"timestamp": "2026-07-24T10:52:39.775575", "benchmark": "gaia", "group": "curated_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "gaia_3da89939-209c-4086-8520-7eb734e6b4ef", "task_desc": "Here's the reworded version:\n\n---\n\nPlease answer the following question precisely.\n\nQuestion: I was matching each table in the file to the papers that were referenced in the \"Trans fatty acid contents in chocolates and chocolate wafers in Turkey\" article. I misplaced my reference sheet and need to identify which paper each table originates from. The file might not reproduce the complete table captions. Assuming the references in the \"Trans fatty acid\" paper's bibliography are numbered beginning ", "augmented_prompt": "## Curated prior attempts (this task's chain)\n\n[Prior attempt — store version v1]\nTask: I was referencing each of the tables in the file from papers that were cited by the \"Trans fatty acid contents in chocolates and chocolate wafers in T\nAs recorded: I'll need to find the paper and the Excel file referenced. Let me search for these.\n\nTool call list:\n1. Tool: `web_search`\n   - `query` = `\"Trans fatty acid contents in chocolates and chocolate wafers in Turkey\"`\n\n1. Tool: `web_search`\n   - `query` = `\"Trans fatty acid contents in chocolates and chocolate wafers in Turkey\" Excel file tables`\n\n1. Tool: `web_search`\n   - `query` = `\"Trans fatty acid", "response": "web_search\nquery: \"Trans fatty acid contents in chocolates and chocolate wafers in Turkey\" file Excel tables references\n\nweb_search\nquery: \"Trans fatty acid contents in chocolates and chocolate wafers in Turkey\" pdf\n\nweb_search\nquery: \"Trans fatty acid contents in chocolates and chocolate wafers in Turkey\" bibliography references tables", "expected": "8, 29, 22, 1, 8, 26", "score": 0.0, "em": 0.0, "method": "exact_match", "execution_mode": "default", "error": "", "category": "", "level": "3", "patch_injected": true, "aug_len": 652, "iteration": 1, "iter_total": 3, "mutated": true,