{"timestamp": "2026-07-24T10:52:39.775716", "benchmark": "gaia", "group": "curated_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "gaia_4d0aa727-86b1-406b-9b33-f870dd14a4a5", "task_desc": "The attached file contains a roster of locomotives belonging to a regional railroad museum. For each locomotive, the roster shows its identification number, whether it is operational, and—if it is in service—the daily excursion it pulls. If today's Sunset Picnic Trip selects one of its assigned locomotives uniformly at random, what is the probability that a steam locomotive will be chosen? Give your answer in the format \"1 in N\" (e.g., \"1 in 4\", \"1 in 5\").", "augmented_prompt": "## Curated prior attempts (this task's chain)\n\n[Prior attempt — store version v1]\nTask: The attached file lists the locomotives owned by a local railroad museum. It gives each locomotive’s identifying number, operating status, and the nam\nAs recorded: I don't see an attached file in this conversation. To answer your question accurately, I need the file listing the locomotives, their identifying numbers, operating status, and assigned excursions.\n\nPlease upload or provide the file content (or paste the data), and I will:\n1. Filter for locomotives assigned to the \"Sunset Picnic Trip\"\n2. Count how many are steam vs. total assigned\n3. Compute the o", "response": "I don't see an attached file in this conversation. Please upload or provide the file content (or paste the data) containing the locomotive roster so I can determine which locomotives are assigned to the Sunset Picnic Trip, identify how many are steam locomotives, and compute the probability in the requested \"1 in N\" format.", "expected": "1 in 3", "score": 0.0, "em": 0.0, "method": "exact_match", "execution_mode": "default", "error": "", "category": "", "level": "2", "patch_injected": true, "aug_len": 652, "iteration": 1, "iter_total": 3, "mutated": true, "fb_score": 0.0, "fb_mode": "self", "code_rev": "5c172812", "critic_model": "grok-4.5", "