{"timestamp": "2026-07-24T10:52:39.775828", "benchmark": "gaia", "group": "curated_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "gaia_1f975693-876d-457b-a649-393859e79bf3", "task_desc": "Rewrite the following request, keeping all details (entities, numbers, constraints, expected answer format) exactly the same, and changing only wording and sentence structure:\n\n---\n\nI missed my Friday classes due to illness, so now I'm trying to catch up on what to review for my Calculus mid-term next week. A classmate sent me an audio clip of Professor Willowbrook announcing the recommended reading for the exam, but my headphones aren't working.\n\nCould you listen to the recording for me and tel", "augmented_prompt": "## Curated prior attempts (this task's chain)\n\n[Prior attempt — store version v1]\nTask: Hi, I was out sick from my classes on Friday, so I'm trying to figure out what I need to study for my Calculus mid-term next week. My friend from clas\nAs recorded: I don't have access to the attached Homework.mp3 file or any audio playback/transcription tools in this environment, so I cannot listen to the recording. Please upload the file or provide a transcript/text of the recording, and I will extract the page numbers for you.", "response": "Because I was sick and absent from class on Friday, I need to determine what to prepare for my Calculus mid-term exam next week. A friend shared an audio message from Professor Willowbrook listing the suggested reading for the test, but I cannot use my headphones to hear it.\n\nPlease play the attached Homework.mp3 file and identify the page numbers I should study. Provide only those page numbers as a comma-separated list arranged from smallest to largest.", "expected": "132, 133, 134, 197, 245", "score": 0.0, "em": 0.0, "method": "exact_match", "execution_mode": "default", "error": "", "category": "", "level": "1", "patch_injected": true, "aug_len": 520, "iteration": 1, "iter_total": 3, "mutated": true, "fb_score": 1.0, "fb_mode": "self", "c