{"timestamp": "2026-07-24T11:00:20.849716", "benchmark": "gaia", "group": "curated_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "gaia_676e5e31-a554-4acc-9286-b60d90a92d26", "task_desc": "Reword the following task, keeping all facts, numbers, entities, constraints, and the expected answer identical—only alter the wording and sentence structure:\n\n---\n\nDetermine the answer to the question below with precision.\n\nQuestion: Starting from July 2, 1959, the United States issued standards for grades of processed fruits, vegetables, and certain other products categorized as dehydrated. Within the \"dried and dehydrated section,\" include only those items explicitly labeled as dehydrated. Al", "augmented_prompt": "## Curated prior attempts (this task's chain)\n\n[Prior attempt — store version v1]\nTask: In July 2, 1959 United States standards for grades of processed fruits, vegetables, and certain other products listed as dehydrated, consider the item\nAs recorded: Based on the July 2, 1959 Federal Register notice establishing U.S. Standards for Grades of Processed Fruits, Vegetables, and Certain Other Products, the relevant items are:\n\n**Dehydrated items (from Dried and Dehydrated section marked \"Dehydrated\"):**\n1. Dehydrated Apples\n2. Dehydrated Carrots\n3. Dehydrated Celery\n4. Dehydrated Onions\n5. Dehydrated Potatoes\n6. Dehydrated Sweet Potatoes\n7. Dehydra", "response": "Reworded task (facts, numbers, entities, constraints, and expected answer unchanged):\n\nUsing the U.S. grade standards for processed fruits, vegetables, and certain other products issued on July 2, 1959, look at the items listed as dehydrated in the \"dried and dehydrated\" section (keep only those explicitly marked dehydrated), and also take any items from the Frozen/Chilled section whose complete names are shown, leaving out anything tagged Chilled. By August 2023, what percentage—rounded to the nearest whole number—of those standards had been superseded by a later revision released after the date given in the 1959 standards?", "expected": "86", "score": 0.0, "em": 0.0, "method": "exact_match", "execution_mode": "default", "error": "", "category": "", "level": "3", "patch_injected": true, "aug_len": 652, "iteration": 1, "iter_total": 3, "mutated": true, "fb_score": 0.95, "fb_mode": "self", "code_rev": "5c172812", "critic_model": "grok-4.5", "metadata_author": "critic", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "meta", "score_provenance": "self_assessment", "judge_model": "hy3", "protocol_hash": "eaae534dbfcc", "prof_total_s": 453.53, "prof_embed_s": 0.0, "prof_docker_s": 0.0, "prof_llm_io_s": 453.53, "prof_tok_in": 544, "prof_tok_out": 136, "prof_llm_calls": 1}
