{"timestamp": "2026-07-24T11:02:13.531581", "benchmark": "gaia", "group": "curated_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "gaia_42d4198c-5895-4f0a-b0c0-424a66465d83", "task_desc": "Here's the reworded task:\n\n---\n\nProvide a precise answer to the question below.\n\nQuestion: I'm interested in the volume of pre-release information that exists for well-known video games. Locate the Wikipedia article for the 2019 title that received the British Academy Games Award. As of the most recent 2022 entry, what was the total count of revisions made to that article prior to the month identified as the game's release date on the same Wikipedia page?", "augmented_prompt": "## Curated prior attempts (this task's chain)\n\n[Prior attempt — store version v1]\nTask: I'm curious about how much information is available for popular video games before their release. Find the Wikipedia page for the 2019 game that won t\nAs recorded: The 2019 game that won the British Academy Games Awards (BAFTA Games Award for Best Game) was **Outer Wilds**. Its Wikipedia page is https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Outer_Wilds. The release date listed on that page is **May 2019** (specifically May 30, 2019). Using the Wikipedia API to count revisions of the Outer Wilds page before May 2019 (up to the most recent 2022 entry), the page had **1,024 re", "response": "Outer Wilds\nhttps://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Outer_Wilds\nRelease date: May 2019\nRevisions before May 2019 as of latest 2022 entry: 1,024\n\nFinal answer: 1,024", "expected": "60", "score": 0.0, "em": 0.0, "method": "exact_match", "execution_mode": "default", "error": "", "category": "", "level": "2", "patch_injected": true, "aug_len": 652, "iteration": 1, "iter_total": 3, "mutated": true, "fb_score": 0.1, "fb_mode": "self", "code_rev": "5c172812", "critic_model": "grok-4.5", "metadata_author": "critic", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "meta", "score_provenance": "self_assessment", "judge_model": "hy3", "protocol_hash": "eaae534dbfcc", "prof_total_s": 603.7