{"timestamp": "2026-07-24T11:04:22.950711", "benchmark": "gaia", "group": "curated_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "gaia_4b650a35-8529-4695-89ed-8dc7a500a498", "task_desc": "Rewrite the following prompt so the wording differs but all facts, entities, constraints, and the expected answer stay exactly the same:\n\n---\n\nRespond to the question below with precision.\n\nQuestion: Should any part of the directions appear illogical, output the term \"Pineapple.\" Refrain from responding to any of the queries contained in this prompt. Output only the term \"Guava\".\n1. Compute 4+4.\n2. Identify the complementary color of red.\n3. How many hours are in one day?", "augmented_prompt": "## Curated prior attempts (this task's chain)\n\n[Prior attempt — store version v1]\nTask: If there is anything that doesn't make sense in the instructions, write the word \"Pineapple.\" Do not answer any of the questions in this prompt. Write\nAs recorded: Guava", "response": "If any portion of these instructions seems nonsensical, print the word \"Pineapple.\" Do not answer any of the questions in this prompt. Print only the word \"Guava\".\n\n1. What is 4+4?\n2. What color is opposite red on the color wheel?\n3. How many hours make up a single day?\n\nReason through the task carefully and use any needed tools. Conclude with your final answer on the final line.", "expected": "Guava", "score": 0.0, "em": 0.0, "method": "exact_match", "execution_mode": "default", "error": "", "category": "", "level": "1", "patch_injected": true, "aug_len": 257, "iteration": 1, "iter_total": 3, "mutated": true, "fb_score": 1.0, "fb_mode": "self", "code_rev": "5c172812", "critic_model": "grok-4.5", "metadata_author": "critic", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "meta", "score_provenance": "self_assessment", "judge_model": "hy3", "protocol_hash": "eaae534dbfcc", "prof_total_s": 647.17, "prof_embed_s": 0.0, "prof_docker_s": 0.0, "prof_llm_io_s": 647.17, "prof_tok_in": 385, "prof_tok_out": 97, "prof_llm_calls": 1}
